        "title": "SHAME ON YOU NEPALI PEOPLE!!!!",
        "text": "I have travelled a lot around the world and unfortunately this is my worst rewiev ever!!\n\nThis is absolutely tourist unfriendly and racisstic place !!!! They would try to Rip you off on Many ways so:\n\nDEAR FUTURE TOURIST PLEASE READ:\n\nEntrance fee is 1000 rp (10$) and be careful because they would just start follow you to \"show you the way\" and start guiding you without asking you anything !\nBe careful about that and always know what are you dealing with. \nAlso, there would be some people who will present themselves like \" students who would like to talk with you to improve their english\"!! Don't - it's a trap- they will Rip you off!\nThere are some kids also who will come to you and pull your hand asking for moneY.\n\nLast but not the least: DON'T TAKE PHOTOS WITH THE \"Holy\" people unless you wanna pay another 1000-2000 rp!!\nBefore taking photos they would tell you that you can pay how much you want (It's donation) and after taking photos they just tell you the price. \nSHAME ON YOU!!! How come is that \" holy\" and modest life when you earn in 5 seconds as much as someone earn for 1-2 days actually hard working! SHAME on you!\n\nPlace is interesting to see the Way they cremate dead people and to see a lots Of monkeys but is also quite devasted during earthquake :/",
